  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCPM Djidja Maize Warrantage Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Cereal (maize marketinga0, Beneficiaries: 534 (126 women), Description: The project will increase producers&apos; negotiating leverage due to high quantities and quality of storage, trainings on better farming practices leading to better and more consistent yields, and a revolving fund to allow for advance payment to farmers improving their cash flow and discouraging side selling.</narrative>
  </description>
